<title>USA: Imation Corp Q3 shr profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Imation Corp Q3 shr profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>OAKDALE, Minn. 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	profit	  $0.29     loss	 $0.04</p>
<p> Net	profit	 11,800     loss	 1,800</p>
<p> Revs		     559,300		  546,200</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  40,800		   42,000</p>
<p>	  Nine months</p>
<p> Shr	loss	    $0.48   profit	 $0.06</p>
<p> Net	loss	   19,900   profit	 2,500</p>
<p> Revs		   1,696,600		1,687,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  41,500		   42,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: First Call estimate was $0.14 per share for Q3.</p>
<p>Average shares before July 1, 1996 are one-tenth the number of Minnesota Mining and Manufacturing Co shares outstanding based on distribution of one Imation Corp share for 10 shares 3M in the spinoff on July 1.</p>
</text>
